  "body": "Ran into a type error in the code here: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#page-visibility\r\n\r\n> When a user-agent determines that the [system visibility state](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#system-visibility-state) for [traversable navigable](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#traversable-navigable) traversable has changed to newState, it must run the following steps:\r\n> **Let navigables be the [inclusive descendant navigables](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#inclusive-descendant-navigables) of traversable.**\r\n\r\n[**inclusive descendant navigables**](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#inclusive-descendant-navigables) takes a `Document`, but *traversable* here is a **navigable**.",
